# Root build-context exclusions for the ClusterFuzzLite docker build
# (context = repo root, Dockerfile = .clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile, COPY .
# = whole tree). Local build artifacts and git history don't belong in the
# builder image; CI checkouts are shallow and clean anyway, so this mainly
# keeps local `docker build` runs honest and fast.
.git
target
fuzz/target
